{"name": "StarSavior", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"144\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3609080/extras/92f04dfc00d0cbca66ef71ee109c848c.poster.avif?t=1784776433\" width=\"420\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3609080/extras/92f04dfc00d0cbca66ef71ee109c848c.webm?t=1784776433\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3609080/extras/92f04dfc00d0cbca66ef71ee109c848c.mp4?t=1784776433\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Long ago, the legendary Star Savior defeated the Void Star.<br/>Now, the Journey\u2014a trial to inherit the great power he left behind\u2014begins once more.<br/>Take on the Journey alongside star-powered girls and inherit the legacy of the Star Savior.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"146\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3609080/extras/25c5325480f08d5d6a58e749b6e5baf8.poster.avif?t=1784776433\" width=\"420\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3609080/extras/25c5325480f08d5d6a58e749b6e5baf8.webm?t=1784776433\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3609080/extras/25c5325480f08d5d6a58e749b6e5baf8.mp4?t=1784776433\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A training RPG to raise a new shining light to illuminate the cosmos in an age where the stars are fading.<br/>StarSavior: Guide your Saviors through the star-kissed Journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"146\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3609080/extras/25a47cdb0e88c1be676ed0e6d39354fb.poster.avif?t=1784776433\" width=\"420\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3609080/extras/25a47cdb0e88c1be676ed0e6d39354fb.webm?t=1784776433\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3609080/extras/25a47cdb0e88c1be676ed0e6d39354fb.mp4?t=1784776433\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>\u25a0 A Journey with girls who wield the power of the stars</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You become the Captain of the Savior Party, tasked with leading the star-powered girls known as Saviors.<br/>Forge bonds with star-powered Saviors and lead them through the Journey\u2014to inherit the legacy of the Star Savior.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"146\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3609080/extras/a61334d8af6b43a45c57766fe45a9ca2.poster.avif?t=1784776433\" width=\"420\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3609080/extras/a61334d8af6b43a45c57766fe45a9ca2.webm?t=1784776433\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3609080/extras/a61334d8af6b43a45c57766fe45a9ca2.mp4?t=1784776433\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>\u25a0 Turn-based battles with cinematic skill animations</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each Savior possesses unique abilities and traits.<br/>Combine their distinct skills and attributes with stunning visual effects to build the optimal party,<br/>and overcome formidable enemies through turn-based combat guided by your strategy as Captain.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" crossorigin=\"anonymous\" height=\"146\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3609080/extras/73b8fffb747da645634c2d40b61d502d.poster.avif?t=1784776433\" width=\"420\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3609080/extras/73b8fffb747da645634c2d40b61d502d.webm?t=1784776433\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>\u25a0 The legacy of the Star Savior \u2014 and a new story</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Follow in the footsteps of the Star Savior and uncover a new tale.<br/>Experience a story where past and future, fate and bonds, intertwine.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"150\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3609080/extras/e4f62cd41efcfc9938eb372ef7d3f227.poster.avif?t=1784776433\" width=\"420\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3609080/extras/e4f62cd41efcfc9938eb372ef7d3f227.webm?t=1784776433\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3609080/extras/e4f62cd41efcfc9938eb372ef7d3f227.mp4?t=1784776433\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"144\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3609080/extras/2fcdbb6798dcfbbc2e972143f39bd04b.poster.avif?t=1784776433\" width=\"420\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3609080/extras/2fcdbb6798dcfbbc2e972143f39bd04b.webm?t=1784776433\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3609080/extras/2fcdbb6798dcfbbc2e972143f39bd04b.mp4?t=1784776433\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>\u25a0 Anime-style illustrations and 3D graphics</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The world of StarSavior comes alive through anime-style illustrations,<br/>paired with 3D visuals rendered in a distinct aesthetic.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p> </div>", "short_desc": "Guide your star-kissed Saviors.", "header_image": "https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3609080/e2601b8f08af778847a964c321f5354bce21ad1e/header.jpg?t=1784776433", "screenshots": [], "tags": ["RPG", "Sexual Content", "Turn-Based Strategy", "Free to Play", "Turn-Based Tactics", "3D"], "developers": "Studiobside", "publishers": "Studiobside", "release_date": "Dec 10, 2025", "price": "Free To Play", "appid": "3609080", "review_type": "Not Recommended", "curator_desc": "10 July 2025 - Request Access\n\n11 December 2025 - Free To Play", "yt_link": "https://youtu.be/z2AGLVVryIA", "first_seen": 1752098400.0, "review_rank": 1562}